omarchy-nvim is the Neovim configuration shipped with Omarchy: the LazyVim
starter configuration plus Omarchy customizations (live theme reloading,
transparency, a remote-session clipboard provider and a few defaults).

The configuration is installed read-only under share/omarchy-nvim/config
for users or tooling to copy into ~/.config/nvim. On first start
lazy.nvim downloads the plugins with git.
